### 댓글 목록
GET http://localhost:4001/api/comments

### 1번 게시물의 댓글만
GET http://localhost:4001/api/comments?postId=1

### 댓글 하나
GET http://localhost:4001/api/comments/1

### 없는 댓글
GET http://localhost:4001/api/comments/999

### 번호가 들어갈 곳에 아무 글자나
GET http://localhost:4001/api/comments/abc

### 없는 댓글 지우기
DELETE http://localhost:4001/api/comments/999
